  "prefLabel": "Ed 607.04 Professional Education Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 607.04 Professional Education Requirements. To promote the learning of all students, each professional educator preparation program shall require each graduate of the program to demonstrate evidence of the competencies outlined in Ed 505.03 and Ed 505.04 as applicable.\n\nSource. #13636, eff 5-12-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed600.html"
